Code Example

```javascript
// Implementation sketch: verify policy signature before loading
function loadPolicy(policy, signature, publicKey) {
  if (!verifySignature(policy, signature, publicKey)) {
    throw new Error("Invalid policy signature");
  }
  applyPolicy(policy);
}
```

